1
00:00:01,015 --> 00:00:02,015


2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,660


3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,660
Make it move!

4
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,360
Mooove!

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,040
Move!
He's asleep!

6
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,120
He's boring.

7
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,260
Sorry about him.

8
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:27,480
He doesn't understand what it's like, 
lying there day after day

9
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,700
watching people press their ugly faces in on you.

10
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:35,740
Can you hear me?

11
00:00:39,325 --> 00:00:40,515
It's just...

12
00:00:40,975 --> 00:00:43,185
I've never talked to a snake before...

13
00:00:43,965 --> 00:00:44,965
Do you...

14
00:00:45,565 --> 00:00:46,565
...I mean...

15
00:00:47,085 --> 00:00:48,805
Do you talk to people often?

16
00:00:50,635 --> 00:00:52,235
You're from Burma, aren't you?

17
00:00:52,755 --> 00:00:53,895
Was it nice there?

18
00:00:54,285 --> 00:00:56,285
Do you miss your family?

19
00:00:59,455 --> 00:01:00,455
I see...

20
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:04,400
That's me as well, 
I never knew my parents either.

21
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:06,080
Mummy! Dad! Come here!

22
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:07,960
You won't believe what this snake is doing!

23
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,700
Thankssss

24
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,760
Anytime!

25
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,120
Snake!

26
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,720
Mum! Mummy!

27
00:02:00,860 --> 00:02:02,080
My darling boy!

28
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:08,500


29
00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:09,740


